# ============================================================================
#  POWERKING NEPAL — ENVIRONMENT
# ============================================================================
#  Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit a filled-in one.
#
#      cp .env.example .env
#
#  Both values below are PUBLIC. They are compiled into the built site on
#  purpose: the anon key identifies the Supabase project, and Row Level
#  Security decides what any holder of it may actually read or write. You can
#  paste them into a public repository without harm — and you cannot avoid
#  shipping them, because the browser needs them to talk to the database.
#
#  Find both under: Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  WHAT MUST NEVER GO IN THIS FILE, OR IN ANY FILE IN THIS REPOSITORY
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  • the service_role key — it bypasses Row Level Security completely
#  • the database password or a direct postgres:// connection string
#  • any personal access token
#
#  This site has no server, so it has nowhere safe to keep one. If a task
#  seems to need the service-role key, it belongs in a database function with
#  SECURITY DEFINER instead, where the rules are still written down and
#  reviewable. The build refuses to publish a service_role key even if one is
#  pasted into SUPABASE_ANON_KEY by mistake.
#
#  Deployment: set SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_ANON_KEY as
#    • GitHub  → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables
#    • Vercel  → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#  The Supabase integration for Vercel sets NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and
#  NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, which this build also accepts as-is.
# ============================================================================
